<section class="hero page-hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</p>
    <h1>Contribute</h1>
    <p>Help improve this resource — corrections, additions, UX improvements welcome.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="page-content">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="measure">
      <div class="detail-section">
        <h3>Rules</h3>
        <ol class="prose">
          <li>Prefer official sources: EUR-Lex, eudi.dev, official EU repositories, official project repos such as WE BUILD.</li>
          <li>Do not add vendor marketing links unless clearly marked and justified.</li>
          <li>Keep summaries neutral and factual.</li>
          <li>Evidence mappings must cite official references where possible.</li>
          <li>Do not claim that the site certifies compliance.</li>
          <li>Official sources always prevail.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-section">
        <h3>What you can contribute</h3>
        <ul class="prose">
          <li>New document references</li>
          <li>Corrections to existing entries</li>
          <li>Logical groupings and reading routes</li>
          <li>Evidence mappings and test scenarios</li>
          <li>Glossary entries</li>
          <li>Links to official specs and publications</li>
          <li>Broken-link fixes</li>
          <li>UX and accessibility improvements</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-section">
        <h3>How to contribute</h3>
        <div class="card mb-4">
          <h4 class="card-title">Via GitHub</h4>
          <ol class="prose-sm">
            <li>Fork the <a href="https://github.com/forkbombeu/eudi-conformance-atlas" target="_blank" rel="noopener">repository</a>.</li>
            <li>Create a branch for your changes.</li>
            <li>Update the YAML data files in <code class="font-mono">data/</code> or other files as needed.</li>
            <li>Submit a pull request with a clear description.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4 class="card-title">Via issue</h4>
          <p class="prose-sm">
            If you notice an error or have a suggestion but don't want to submit a PR, <a href="https://github.com/forkbombeu/eudi-conformance-atlas/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open an issue</a> with details.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-section">
        <h3>License</h3>
        <p class="prose">
          By contributing, you agree your contribution is licensed under <strong>Apache-2.0</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-end">
      <a href="https://github.com/forkbombeu/eudi-conformance-atlas/blob/main/src/contribute.njk" class="edit-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Edit this page on GitHub</a>
